    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C2",
      "text": "Operating income increased by $1,906 million, or 10.28% (calculated from reported values; filing reports rounded 10%), from $18,545 million in fiscal year 2024 to $20,451 million in fiscal year 2025 (Item 7, EP_0013_E01). This improvement was largely due to a reduction in selling, general and administrative costs and the absence of a $1.3 billion non-cash impairment charge on the PRODUCT_45 intangible asset that occurred in the prior year (Item 7, EP_0013_E01).",
