          "label": "FY2024",
          "start": "2023-07-01",
          "end": "2024-06-30"
        },
        "to_period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2024-07-01",
          "end": "2025-06-30"
        },
        "value": "10.28",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C3",
      "text": "Net earnings increased by $1,091 million, or 7.29% (calculated from reported values; filing reports rounded 7%), from $14,974 million in fiscal year 2024 to $16,065 million in fiscal year 2025 (Item 7, EP_0013_E01). This increase was driven by the rise in operating income, partially offset by higher restructuring charges, including $801 million after tax related to the liquidation of operations in Argentina (Item 7, EP_0013_E01).",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EP_0013_E01"
      ],
      "check_spec": {
        "kind": "percentage_change",
        "from_fact_id": "EP_0013_F06",
        "to_fact_id": "EP_0013_F05",
        "metric": "net_earnings",
        "from_period": {
          "label": "FY2024",
          "start": "2023-07-01",
          "end": "2024-06-30"
        },
        "to_period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2024-07-01",
          "end": "2025-06-30"
        },
        "value": "7.29",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C4",
      "text": "Cash flow from operating activities decreased by $2,029 million, or 10.22% (calculated from reported values; filing reports rounded (10)%), from $19,846 million in fiscal year 2024 to $17,817 million in fiscal year 2025 (Item 7, EP_0013_E01). This decline in operating cash flow is a notable counterpoint to the increases in net sales, operating income, and net earnings.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EP_0013_E01"
      ],
      "check_spec": {
        "kind": "percentage_change",
        "from_fact_id": "EP_0013_F08",
        "to_fact_id": "EP_0013_F07",
        "metric": "operating_cash_flow",
        "from_period": {
          "label": "FY2024",
          "start": "2023-07-01",
          "end": "2024-06-30"
        },
        "to_period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2024-07-01",
          "end": "2025-06-30"
        },
        "value": "-10.22",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    }
  ],
  "rationale": "COMPANY_13 demonstrated mixed financial performance in fiscal year 2025. While net sales saw a marginal increase, operating income and net earnings showed healthy growth, primarily driven by cost reductions and the absence of prior-year impairment charges. However, a significant decline in cash flow from operating activities raises concerns. The operating cash flow decline of $2.0 billion occurred despite higher earnings, reflecting the impact of non-cash charges such as the $801 million after-tax charge for accumulated foreign currency translation losses due to the substantial liquidation of operations in Argentina, as well as potential working capital movements and higher tax payments (effective tax rate rose to 20.3% from 20.2%). The company operates in a highly competitive consumer products industry, facing ongoing pressures from global and local competitors, evolving sales channels, and changing consumer preferences (Item 1A, EP_0013_E03). The positive earnings growth is tempered by the decrease in cash generation and the competitive landscape, suggesting a HOLD recommendation until there is clearer evidence of sustained cash flow improvement or a stronger competitive advantage."
}

